{
    "title": "Kingdom Guard:Tower Defense TD",
    "description": "Titan has invaded our kingdom, and our guardian dragons have all but disappeared.\r\n\r\nFinally, you discovered the fabled, last dragon egg, just as Titan descends upon you with his dark legions.\r\n\r\nCome train and merge your soldiers, and protect the dragon egg to save the world!\r\n\r\n1. Merge to upgrade\r\nA brand new way of upgrading that doesn't involve boring city building and troop production. Now you have total control over your units! Merge two units of the same level and type to create a higher level unit!\r\n\r\n2. Tower Defense\r\nTrain and merge your soldiers to defend against the enemy. Different defense formations will always yield distinct and surprising results!\r\n\r\n3. Strategy Sandbox Game\r\nJoin an alliance, take over the dark throne, revive the guardian dragon, and achieve glory in this brutal world. Let your name live by becoming the ultimate ruler of the new age!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Titan has invaded our kingdom, and our guardian dragons have all but disappeared.<br><br>Finally, you discovered the fabled, last dragon egg, just as Titan descends upon you with his dark legions.<br><br>Come train and merge your soldiers, and protect the dragon egg to save the world!<br><br>1. Merge to upgrade<br>A brand new way of upgrading that doesn&#39;t involve boring city building and troop production. Now you have total control over your units! Merge two units of the same level and type to create a higher level unit!<br><br>2. Tower Defense<br>Train and merge your soldiers to defend against the enemy. Different defense formations will always yield distinct and surprising results!<br><br>3. Strategy Sandbox Game<br>Join an alliance, take over the dark throne, revive the guardian dragon, and achieve glory in this brutal world. Let your name live by becoming the ultimate ruler of the new age!",
